This Explorers base is a location that appeared in ''[[HZ107|Friends as Two, Me and You]]''. It is located not far from [[Manpūku Town]]. [[Spinel]] held the [[Six Heroes]] captive at the base until they were transferred to an unknown location in order to prevent [[Liko]] and the others from finding them.

